tickets/in-progress/api-key-management-panel-performance/investigation-notes.md:282:- Using that resolved value, exact `/models` returned `401` / `InvalidApiKey`. A non-inference `GET` control against `/chat/completions` also returned `401` / `invalid_api_key`; no completion request was made and no model credits were consumed. The same authentication rejection on the inference route rules out an AutoByteus-only `/models` parser or endpoint-construction failure as the cause of the observed state.
tickets/in-progress/api-key-management-panel-performance/investigation-notes.md:289:- Alibaba classifies `401-InvalidApiKey/invalid_api_key` as an incorrect key, with common causes including a wrong/deleted key or a plan/endpoint/region mismatch: <https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/error-code>.
tickets/in-progress/api-key-management-panel-performance/solution-revision-record.md:190:### SR-008 — Classify DR-004 as external authentication and defer cosmetic null-count rendering
tickets/in-progress/api-key-management-panel-performance/solution-revision-record.md:195:- Current authoritative result: the observed discovery failure is an Alibaba Cloud credential/account authorization rejection, not an established AutoByteus code or configured-base-URL defect. The separate `null models` string is a bounded AutoByteus presentation defect; the user explicitly accepts deferring it and requests no update. No solution behavior is revised.
tickets/in-progress/api-key-management-panel-performance/solution-revision-record.md:196:- Why this revision entry is recorded: source inspection plus secret-safe live diagnostics proved the configured official Token Plan endpoint receives the expected Bearer request, while Alibaba returns `401 InvalidApiKey` for exact `/models` and the non-inference `/chat/completions` route control. The stored secret was never printed or recorded; only its documented Token Plan key class was classified.
tickets/in-progress/api-key-management-panel-performance/solution-revision-record.md:200:  - Record the official Alibaba endpoint/key pairing and `401 InvalidApiKey` interpretation alongside the sanitized live evidence.
tickets/in-progress/api-key-management-panel-performance/solution-revision-record.md:210:- Downstream and architecture-review impact: no architecture, implementation, code-review, or API/E2E reroute is required because the user authorized no product change. Delivery may update `DR-004` to external authentication with accepted cosmetic deferral and proceed with finalization/release.

